WHY THE MULTIPLICITY IS THE FEATURE, not a hazard to be resolved: a design language is used to
RELATE one domain to another. A term that means one thing can only describe; a term that means
several can carry a reader across. The cost is real and it is the cost Corwin named -- writing a
document relating language C1 to language C4 gets harder, not easier. That cost is paid at the
DOCUMENT, never by amputating the term.

